Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 22:45:38 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 43/47] metal: GPU convolution via Hermitian expansion + vkFFT
 c2c

mx_convolve_c2r expands half->full (validated 8e-08 vs ducc0) and runs
the proven c2c inverse (5e-07 at 3072). Thread-local plans, square-only
with CPU fallback, MX_METAL_NO_CONVOLVE kill-switch. Registered behind
-mgpu alongside the peak hook. 1024 multiscale gate: all T2 PASS.

